---
title: "Memory: one stored fact"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Visible
    lg1: Hidden
    lg2: Gone
  }
  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 tan
  class lg2 pink
  s0: Live: recalled when relevant
  s1: Expired: hidden, kept
  s2: Deleted with every version
  s3: Deleted: merged into a summary row
  s4: Superseded: hidden, kept as history
  s5: Handed to the model in a turn
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: its expiry passes
  s0 --> s2: the owner deletes it or a newer version
  s0 --> s3: its group is summarized [2+ facts, older than 7 days]
  s0 --> s4: a newer fact replaces it
  s0 --> s5: a question matches it
  s4 --> s2: the owner deletes it or a newer version
  s5 --> s0: use count updated after the answer
  class s0 teal
  class s1 tan
  class s2 pink
  class s3 pink
  class s4 tan
  class s5 teal
